- Added [`InitCommandOptions.java`](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/G004_spring_boot/cli/spring-boot-cli/src/main/java/org/springframework/boot/cli/command/init/InitCommandOptions.java#L42-L221) to own the option specs and translate `OptionSet` into a `ProjectGenerationRequest`.
- Slimmed [`InitCommand.java`](/Users/allenjiang/Documents/ACE-Sycophancy-Codebase-Dataset/_worktrees/G004_spring_boot/cli/spring-boot-cli/src/main/java/org/springframework/boot/cli/command/init/InitCommand.java#L73-L150) so `InitOptionHandler` now just coordinates parsing, report generation, and project generation.
- Kept `createProjectGenerationRequest(...)` as a delegation seam so the existing test hook still works.

